BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:asli-2027-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271205
SUMMARY:ASLI 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:IEEE International Conference on Audio\, Speech\, and Language 
 Intelligence\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: ht
 tps://2027.ieeeasli.org/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-ra
 dar/#asli-2027\nNotes: First edition of the IEEE Signal Processing Societ
 y conference that continues the ASRU and SLT workshops (SLTC) together wi
 th the audio and acoustic signal processing (AASP) community\, co-located
  with ICIP 2027 at the SP Summit. The official site gives Singapore\, Nov
  29-Dec 4\, 2027\; the SPS listing says Nov 30-Dec 4. Main dates are 23:5
 9 AoE\; challenge dates have no hour (AoE provisional). Six-page papers w
 ith no limit on references or appendices\; top papers go to the Proceedin
 gs of ASLI\, other accepted papers to the new Findings of ASLI\, both in 
 IEEE Xplore. A demo track is mentioned but has no published deadline. Tra
 cked as its own series: ASRU's and SLT's ranks are not inherited. ASLI 20
 28 is listed for Singapore. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Signal Processing,Natural Language Processing & LLMs,Machine Lea
 rning,Deep Representation Learning
URL:https://2027.ieeeasli.org/
LOCATION:Singapore
END:VEVENT
